# generated / regenerable — rebuild with: python run.py && python report.py
.venv/
__pycache__/
traces/
# NOTE (2026-08-07): `results/` used to be ignored here, because this directory sat on
# `plans` — an orphan branch of internal planning state that results had no business
# landing in. That move has happened: this is now its own `autoscaling-viz` branch, whose
# whole purpose includes holding the result corpus. So results are TRACKED and the ignore
# line is gone. Deliberate, not an oversight.
#
# One rule survives the move, and it is a rule rather than a size budget: no prompt or
# response text is ever committed, in any form. See real-trace/*/.gitignore.
# out/ IS committed (rendered HTML + figures, so the deck is viewable without a Python env)
# ...except the sweep-table cache, which is a local recompute-skip artifact (design §8.1 item 10(d)).
out/.sweep-cache.json
